<section class="legal-body">

  <h2>Overview</h2>
  <p>Rafhin Visuals ("we," "us") is a video and photo production studio based in Toronto, Ontario, serving the Greater Toronto Area and clients across Canada. This policy explains what information this website (rafhin.com) collects, how it's used, and who it's shared with.</p>

  <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
  <p><strong>Information you provide.</strong> When you use the contact form, we collect your name, email address, and the message you send, so we can respond to your inquiry.</p>
  <p><strong>Information collected automatically.</strong> Like most websites, we use analytics to understand how visitors use the site: pages visited, approximate location (city/region level), device and browser type, and how you arrived at the site.</p>

  <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To respond to inquiries and provide quotes for video, photography, or web design projects</li>
    <li>To understand how visitors use the site and improve it</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
  <p>This site relies on a few third-party services, each operating under its own privacy policy:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Google Analytics</strong> &mdash; traffic analytics</li>
    <li><strong>Google Fonts</strong> &mdash; font delivery</li>
    <li><strong>Formspree</strong> &mdash; processes and delivers contact form submissions</li>
    <li><strong>Vimeo</strong> &mdash; hosts and embeds the video work shown on this site</li>
    <li><strong>Vercel</strong> &mdash; website hosting</li>
  </ul>
  <p>These services may collect data independently (for example, via cookies) when you interact with embedded content.</p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>Google Analytics sets cookies to measure site usage. We don't use advertising or retargeting cookies.</p>

  <h2>Data Sharing</h2>
  <p>We don't sell or rent your personal information. Contact form submissions are used solely to respond to your inquiry.</p>

  <h2>Data Retention</h2>
  <p>We retain contact form submissions for as long as needed to respond to your inquiry, and for a reasonable period afterward for record-keeping.</p>

  <h2>Your Rights</h2>
  <p>You can ask for a copy of, or request deletion of, any information you've submitted by emailing <a href="mailto:{{ contact.email }}">{{ contact.email }}</a>.</p>

  <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
  <p>This policy may be updated from time to time. The date at the top reflects the latest revision.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about this policy can be sent to <a href="mailto:{{ contact.email }}">{{ contact.email }}</a>.</p>

